From: XiaoqiangWu <wuxiaoqiang.rtos@huawei.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 09:42:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] feature: add knowledge distillation (v0.6.0 port)

Port the v0.5.1 KD patch onto v0.6.0. Adds kd / teacher_train_config /
decoder_out_dim config fields and the compute_kd_loss forward hooks for
ACT, Diffusion, and PI05, plus the standalone knowledge_distillation
training entrypoint. lerobot_train.py integration is deferred (depends on
the v0.6.0 training-loop restructure); model loading and KD forward work.
